# Paths hidden from ripgrep-based search (and therefore from AI assistants)
# while still being tracked by git.
#
# Docs/obj holds the committed DocFX metadata that the GitHub Pages build
# consumes: Docs/docfx.json reads "obj/temp/api" as build content, and
# Docs/toc.yml links to it. It cannot be gitignored without deleting the API
# section of the published site. It is 2419 generated files, so searching it
# buries real source hits under YAML noise.
#
# Look things up in INDEX.tsv instead -- see the "Finding things" section of
# CLAUDE.md.
Docs/obj/
